	(descr "e-peas AEM10300 harvest PMIC, QFN 28-pin 4x4 mm. Land taken verbatim from the placed U8 footprint on solar-glow-drh-v4_0.kicad_pcb, which matches the datasheet recommended board layout: DS-AEM10300-v1.4 §15.2 Figure 18 -- 28 perimeter pads 0.8 x 0.2 on 0.4 pitch, exposed-pad land 2.30 x 2.30. Package body is 4.000 +/- 0.05 square, thickness 0.800 +/- 0.05 (§15.1 Figure 17); the package EP is 2.600, the LAND is 2.300 -- that difference is intentional. Split out of solarglow:U1 on 2026-07-28: U1 (AVR64EA28) and U8 shared that name while carrying DIFFERENT exposed pads (2.65 vs 2.30), so one name described two lands.")
